@page "/accommodations"
<PageTitle>Taniti : Accommodations & Travel</PageTitle>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Lodging Overview
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                @* <h2 class="card-title">Lodging Overview</h2> *@
                <p class="card-text">
                    Taniti offers a wide range of lodging options for visitors, from budget-friendly stays
                    to more upscale accommodations. All lodging types on the island are closely regulated
                    and regularly inspected by the Tanitian government.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">Inexpensive hostel available</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Many small, family-owned hotels</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Growing number of bed and breakfasts</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">One large, four-star resort</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">All lodging types strictly regulated and inspected</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/placeholder.png"
                 alt="Lodging Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-end lodging-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Air Travel
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                @* <h2 class="card-title">Air Travel</h2> *@
                <p class="card-text">
                    Most visitors arrive in Taniti by air, with the island’s airport serving as the primary
                    entry point. Expansion efforts are underway to support larger aircraft in the future.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">Most visitors arrive by air</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Small cruise ship docks once per week</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Airport supports small jets and propeller planes</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Airport expansion planned for larger jets</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/placeholder.png"
                 alt="Air Travel Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-end lodging-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Ground Transportation
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                @* <h2 class="card-title">Ground Transportation</h2> *@
                <p class="card-text">
                    Taniti provides several convenient ways for visitors to travel around the island,
                    including public transit, taxis, rentals, and walkable areas.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">Public buses run 5 a.m. to 11 p.m. in Taniti City</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Private buses serve the rest of the island</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Taxis available in Taniti City</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Rental cars available near the airport</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Bikes and helmets available from vendors (helmets required)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/placeholder.png"
                 alt="Ground Transportation Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-end lodging-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Getting Around Taniti City
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                @* <h2 class="card-title">Getting Around Taniti City</h2> *@
                <p class="card-text">
                    Taniti City is easy to explore on foot thanks to its flat layout and pedestrian-friendly
                    streets. The surrounding areas near Merriton Landing are also walkable for visitors.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">Taniti City is flat and very walkable</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Merriton Landing area easy to explore on foot</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/placeholder.png"
                 alt="City Walkability Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-end lodging-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
